{"slug":"Leetcode-189-Rotate-Arra","title":"Leetcode#189. Rotate Arra","date":"2024-06-30","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","medium","Array","Math","Two Pointers","💡"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"Given an integer array , rotate the array to the right by steps, where is non-negative. Example 1: Example 2: Constraints: - - - Follow up: - Try to come up with as many solutions as you can. There ar","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h1 id=\"problem\"><a href=\"#problem\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>Given an integer array <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>nums</span></span></code></span>, rotate the array to the right by <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>k</span></span></code></span> steps, where <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>k</span></span></code></span> is non-negative.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: nums = [1,2,3,4,5,6,7], k = 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: [5,6,7,1,2,3,4]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Explanation:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>rotate 1 steps to the right: [7,1,2,3,4,5,6]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>rotate 2 steps to the right: [6,7,1,2,3,4,5]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>rotate 3 steps to the right: [5,6,7,1,2,3,4]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: nums = [-1,-100,3,99], k = 2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: [3,99,-1,-100]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Explanation:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>rotate 1 steps to the right: [99,-1,-100,3]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>rotate 2 steps to the right: [3,99,-1,-100]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1 &#x3C;= nums.length &#x3C;= 105</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>231 &#x3C;= nums[i] &#x3C;= 231 - 1</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>0 &#x3C;= k &#x3C;= 105</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Follow up:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Try to come up with as many solutions as you can. There are at least <strong>three</strong> different ways to solve this problem.</li>\n<li>Could you do it in-place with <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>O(1)</span></span></code></span> extra space?</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<h3 id=\"錯1\"><a href=\"#錯1\">錯1</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> rotate</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">], </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">k</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">None</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">        Do not return anything, modify nums in-place instead.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        n </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(nums)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        nums </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> nums[ n </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> k:] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> nums[:n</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">k]</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>由於leetcode 判定nums = nums[ n - k:n] + nums[0:n-k]</p>\n<p>為建造新的一個變數，所以原先的並未改變</p>\n<h3 id=\"改成但資測一樣錯的只是記錄一下leetcode的機制\"><a href=\"#改成但資測一樣錯的只是記錄一下leetcode的機制\">改成(<span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>但資測一樣錯的</span></span></code></span>)，只是記錄一下leetcode的機制</a></h3>\n<p>nums=</p>\n<p>→</p>\n<p>nums[:]</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> rotate</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">], </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">k</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">None</span><span 